==Ancient Greek==

===Alternative spellings===
* {{grc-alt|κλέϝος|dial=pho}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|κλέϝος|tr=klewos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} from {{proto|Indo-European|ḱlewos|lang=grc}}.  Cognates include Sanskrit {{term|श्रवस्|tr=śrávas|lang=sa|sc=Deva}}, Avestan {{term|𐬯𐬭𐬀𐬬𐬀𐬵|sc=Avst|tr=sravah}}, Armenian {{term|լու||sc=Armn|tr=lu|lang=hy}}, Old Church Slavonic {{term|слово|tr=slovo|lang=cu|sc=Cyrs}}, and Old Irish {{term|clú|lang=sga}}.  Compare {{term|κλύω||I hear|tr=kluō|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{grc-ipa-rows|k|l|e'|o|s}}

